  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/647/banner-fullbright-png.png\"></strong></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⚠️ 需要安裝 OptiFine ⚠️</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⚠注意</strong>：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus團隊的所有專案將正式透過devHeycronus帳號，在CurseForge、Modrinth及Planet Minecraft上獨家發布與維護。</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">💡 <strong>FullBright</strong> 是一款Minecraft材質包，能讓你的世界更加明亮清晰！透過增強照明效果，你可以在洞穴、海洋和夜間區域探索時不再需要火把。🌙✨</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">非常適合喜愛在黑暗中探索與建造的玩家——現在每次冒險都更安全、更順暢，且充滿光明！🔦🌎</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/648/fullbight-on-and-off-png.png\"></p>",
